Differentiating w.r.t. $x$, we get

\begin{aligned}
&2 y \frac{d y}{d x}=4 \Rightarrow \frac{d y}{d x}=\frac{2}{y} \\
&\left(\frac{d y}{d x}\right)_{(1,2)}=\frac{2}{2}=1
\end{aligned}

